#: src/reference/guide/scope-basics.md:98
msgid "Inspecting scopes"
msgstr "检查作用域"

#: src/reference/guide/scope-basics.md:100
msgid ""
"In sbt shell, you can use the `inspect` command to understand keys and their "
"scopes. Try `inspect Test / fullClasspath`:"
msgstr ""
"在 sbt shell 中，可以使用 `inspect` 命令来了解键及其作用域。试试 `inspect "
"Test / fullClasspath`："

#: src/reference/guide/scope-basics.md:127
msgid ""
"For more details, see [sbt inspect](../reference/sbt-inspect.md) reference "
"guide."
msgstr "更多详情，请参阅 [sbt inspect](../reference/sbt-inspect.md) 参考指南。"
